Chapter: AmpAfterCall

  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Regression: function application binds tighter than '&', so
 "n=" & show x is "n=" & (show x), not ("n=" & show) x. Result: n=7.

Section: Definitions

  label : Integer -> Text
  label (x) = "n=" & show x

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (label 7)
  end

